<title>USA: Delavan, Wis., won by Griffin Kubik Stephens.</title>
<headline>Delavan, Wis., won by Griffin Kubik Stephens.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Griffin Kubik Stephens &amp; Thompson said it won $2.450 million of Delavan, Wis., waterworks system mortgage revenue refunding bonds, with a true interest cost of 5.40 percent.</p>
</text>
